/*
  FrontendErrorsCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0243 · FrontendErrorsCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `FrontendErrorsCard`
  resolves (table "FrontendErrorsCard") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
